    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 228,
      "toFrame": 251,
      "text": "Meet QueueSaathi."
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 251,
      "toFrame": 387,
      "text": "While patients wait, they answer a few questions by voice, and the"
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 387,
