    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 586,
      "toFrame": 728,
      "text": "Then the answer is structured, every value is checked in code, and"
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 728,
      "toFrame": 799,
      "text": "safety checks run on every reply."
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 828,
      "toFrame": 962,
      "text": "You can speak Hinglish, Hindi or English, however you naturally talk."
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 1293,
      "toFrame": 1421,
      "text": "It moves through short, simple questions, like how long the problem"
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 1421,
      "toFrame": 1444,
      "text": "has lasted."
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 1533,
      "toFrame": 1660,
      "text": "Medicine names are hard to hear, so Prisma gets a list of common Indian"
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 1660,
      "toFrame": 1759,
      "text": "medicines, and Timbre reads every medicine back for the patient to"
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 1759,
