    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 2778,
      "toFrame": 2883,
      "text": "Each summary follows India's ABDM consultation sections, and every"
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 2883,
      "toFrame": 2977,
      "text": "detail links back to the patient's own words."
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 3498,
      "toFrame": 3640,
      "text": "We tested it on 276 scripted recordings from 2 speakers."
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 3640,
      "toFrame": 3711,
      "text": "Medicine-name accuracy: 52% → 95%."
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 3711,
      "toFrame": 3867,
      "text": "All 4 emergency sessions were flagged, and false alarms dropped from"
    },
    {
      "fromFrame": 3867,
